    description: "Residual of INV-gumom (PR #1320). ADR-0061 ruling 5: 'The verify-claims JSON lists every catalogue file the run loaded.' tiers lists the verify-stage files (io, taint, function_summaries) and the user's analysis-stage channel files (stage: analysis), but not the SHIPPED files the analysis consulted while building the graph -- including community ones (99 frameworks files, python-django.yaml signatures, python-pyyaml.yaml dataflow). The graph does not record which were consulted, so listing them needs the analysis to stamp that into the survey (e.g. analysis_runs or limits), and a cached graph must carry it. Until then the gap is stated in the spec's implementation-status table."  # 1b9d
