  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: cli._loaded_catalogue_files still documents 'NOT LISTED: the shipped files of the analysis-stage families' and appends only user_channel_files for frameworks/dataflow_patterns/library_signatures. Live verify-claims --format json on a tiny Django fixture: tiers lists io_primitives, io overlays, taint_* and function_summaries files only; no frameworks, library_signatures or dataflow_patterns file in any tier. Premise holds. MECHANISM: graph/survey does not record which shipped analysis-stage catalogue files were consulted, so verify cannot list them. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-lunih."  # 62f0
